# shellcheck shell=bash
# Invocation behind output/evaluation/der_sweep.csv, der_sweep_summary.csv
# and der_sweep_selection.json (the first diarisation sweep: the pipeline's
# defaults and five clustering thresholds, six cells).
#
# Job 8976358 (au_der_sweep), 2026-10-04, account <project-b>, an NVIDIA
# L40S on htc-g070, on the AMI validation split, from the clone
# ~/paper_speech_transcription_audit_w2 at code 9cb43e3 with a clean tree,
# as its environment record and the selection's git_commit say. The
# record, environment/au_der_sweep_8976358.txt beside the original's
# results on ARC, gives the effective parameters SPLIT=validation,
# CACHE_DIR=${DATA}/ami_cache, THRESHOLDS="0.50 0.60 0.70 0.80 0.90",
# MIN_CLUSTER_SIZES=12, MIN_DURATIONS_OFF=0.0 and OUTPUT_PREFIX=der_sweep,
# and the selection's argv repeats them. Its log,
# logs/der_sweep_8976358.out in that clone, shows the preflight passing
# with --diarisation-required, the 18 meetings read from the timeline cache
# and six configurations, the pipeline defaults first as cfg000.
#
# Job 8534758 (2026-08-10, htc-g067, code not recorded) ran this grid
# first, into .../output/evaluation/der_sweep_dev/; its files are in git at
# aaffb81. It predated sweep_der's pipeline-default cell
# (ab929dd), so it scored five cells, and each of its config ids is one
# lower than the re-run's. The cells both runs scored agree on every
# meeting but IB4002 (audit finding EDER-02, 2bb4224).
#
# The script's default MIN_DURATIONS_OFF="0.0 0.5" does NOT reproduce this
# artefact. CACHE_DIR and OUTPUT_PREFIX below are the script's defaults at
# 9cb43e3, written out so that a later change of a default cannot change
# what this record reproduces.
#
# Reproduce (from the repository root on ARC), on the card type the
# original ran on:
#   ( set -a; . hpc/runs/der_sweep.env || exit 1; set +a
#     sbatch --account='<your-project>' --gres=gpu:l40s:1 hpc/submit_der_sweep.sh )
#
# A reproduction writes to its own directory under repro/, so it cannot
# overwrite the ARC copy of the original run it is to be compared with.
# original: REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/audit2026/der/der_sweep"
SPLIT=validation
CACHE_DIR="${DATA}/ami_cache"
THRESHOLDS="0.50 0.60 0.70 0.80 0.90"
MIN_CLUSTER_SIZES=12
MIN_DURATIONS_OFF="0.0"
OUTPUT_PREFIX=der_sweep
REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/repro/der_sweep"
